              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ચડિયાતું — caḍiyātũ — \"superior\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે રોજ કસરત કરશો તો તમે બીજા ખેલાડીઓ કરતાં ચડિયાતા થશો. jo tame roj kasrat karśo to tame bījā khelāḍīo kartā̃ caḍiyātā thaśo. If you exercise every day, you will be better than the other players."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ચડિયાતું (caḍiyātũ) is built on caḍvũ, \"to climb, to rise\", the same verb as ચઢવું (caḍhvũ), from a reconstructed caḍhati, \"rises\" (CDIAL 4578): one who has climbed higher."
            }
          ]
        },
